WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.155
In this video we'll explore various saving opportunities available to you as an Amazon

00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:08.100
seller and how to take advantage of them.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.102
Amazon offers many programs to help reduce

00:00:12.102 --> 00:00:13.380
your operational costs.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.819
These programs include Amazon lending, large and oversize, Amazon business,

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:26.220
Amazon partnered carrier, Stickerless also known as the manufacturer barcodes program,

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:33.660
Veeqo, send, Amazon warehousing and distribution AWD, and FBA New selection.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.863
To find the savings programs that will benefit your business the most,

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:43.842
think about the size and weight of your products, your sales volume, the channels you sell on,

00:00:43.842 --> 00:00:45.880
and your overall business needs.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.925
Then consider the eligibility requirements

00:00:48.925 --> 00:00:54.120
and potential cost savings of each program to determine the best fit.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.744
Amazon lending provides financing solutions to eligible U.

00:00:58.744 --> 00:01:01.552
S.-based small and medium-sized

00:01:01.552 --> 00:01:06.460
businesses with a proven track record of growth and excellent customer service.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:13.993
The large and oversize program applies to products that meet specific weight or size

00:01:13.993 --> 00:01:19.529
specifications and helps you save on shipping and provide more accurate delivery estimates

00:01:19.529 --> 00:01:23.580
to customers by opting into automated handling time.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.548
Amazon business is designed to help you

00:01:26.548 --> 00:01:31.600
grow your sales to business customers who historically buy more and return less.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.320
This savings program requires you to have a professional selling plan.

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:43.641
The Amazon partnered carrier program allows you to find the lowest cost shipping option across

00:01:43.641 --> 00:01:47.100
carriers based on product size and delivery speed.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.644
The stickerless program enables you to

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:57.100
ship eligible products to FBA using manufacturer barcodes instead of Amazon labels.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:02.065
The Veeqo program is a free multi-channel shipping software that offers Amazon's

00:02:02.065 --> 00:02:10.120
buy shipping rates for all of your orders, including other channels like eBay, Etsy, or Shopify.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:17.708
The send program facilitates cost-effective shipping of FBA inventory from China to U.

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:18.179
S.

00:02:18.179 --> 00:02:19.120
fulfillment centers.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:24.340
Amazon warehousing and distribution AWD provides low-cost bulk storage

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:32.640
solutions for a variety of fulfillment by Amazon FBA products and distributes your inventory to

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:36.140
the Amazon store and other distribution channels.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:40.140
And the FBA new selection program provides rebates,

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:45.140
free storage, and other benefits for new to FBA ASINs.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.436
You may be eligible to participate in more

00:02:48.436 --> 00:02:51.320
than one program to maximize your savings.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:55.077
For example, combining the partnered carrier program

00:02:55.077 --> 00:03:03.929
with Amazon warehousing and distribution helps you save 25% on AWD storage and 15% on processing

00:03:03.929 --> 00:03:05.160
and transportation.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:09.660
Once you have determined which savings programs that you are eligible for,

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.160
you'll need to enroll.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:15.372
For programs such as the large and oversized program, you are automatically

00:03:15.372 --> 00:03:18.180
enrolled if you sell products that are eligible.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.180
Others are built into workflows.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:21.847
For example,

00:03:21.847 --> 00:03:27.180
you can choose whether to use the partnered carrier program in the send to Amazon workflow.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.180
Some programs will require self-enrollment.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.362
You can find enrollment for these programs

00:03:33.362 --> 00:03:35.180
directly in Seller Central.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:39.927
Remember, some programs like Amazon Lending may require an invitation,

00:03:39.927 --> 00:03:47.117
so be sure to double-check the eligibility criteria which you can do by searching Amazon

00:03:47.117 --> 00:03:49.200
Savings Opportunities in Seller Central.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.200
Not eligible for any programs today?

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.042
New programs

00:03:53.042 --> 00:03:59.779
continue to be added, so check the cost savings program page and manage your growth dashboard

00:03:59.779 --> 00:04:00.200
frequently.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.720
Thank you and happy saving in the Amazon store.
